# mixed-code-and-coded-from root
library "Mixed".

// A library where one concept carries BOTH a local `code is` and a NON-`defined
// as` top-level definition (`coded from` here). `code is` + `defined as` is now
// SUPPORTED (both-representation); `code is` + `coded from` (or `definition is`)
// remains a hard error — `lowerLocalCodes` raises `emit-mixed-code-and-definition`
// rather than silently dropping the local-code source side.

terminology "VS":
- valueset is `vs`.

concept "Mixed Concept":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `local-code`.
- coded from "VS".
